t \n\n$$\n{u}_{1}\\cdot {u}_{2}=0\\,\\text{and}\\,‖{u}_{2}‖=1.\n$$\n\n \n\nSolving ${u}_{1}\\cdot {u}_{2}=0,$ which is equivalent to\n\n$$\n-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}{x}_{1}+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}{x}_{2}=0,\n$$\n\nwe get a nonzero solution $\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.$ Normalizing this vector, we finally obtain the  second column of $U:$\n\n$$\n{u}_{2}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\end{bmatrix}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186371298 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371299 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371298 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371300 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371298 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371301 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371298 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371302 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371298 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371303 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371298 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371298 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371298 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186371299 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371298 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "50e0371b-e61c-5694-8b26-5a3118897b89" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371299 #edb/ref 1080 "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\end{bmatrix}" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186371299 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371299 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "aa9fc468-4dcf-5ab9-b9e7-27fd958f8cff" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371300 #edb/ref 1080 "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}} \\\\ \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{10}}\\end{bmatrix}" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186371300 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371300 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "b79d8023-bd9b-5efa-9332-63ce925d35eb" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371301 #edb/ref 1080 "\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}} \\\\ \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}}\\end{bmatrix}" #edb/ref 1759218