trix}-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nFinally, we construct the matrices $U$ and $V:$\n\n$$\nU=\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} & -\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} & \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\end{bmatrix},\\,V=\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} & \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} & \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\end{bmatrix}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186371354 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371355 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371354 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371356 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371354 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371357 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371354 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371358 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371354 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371359 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371354 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371354 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371354 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186371356 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371354 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "568ea8b9-1e08-5c04-9b16-5b0f11806d6e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371355 #edb/ref 1080 "$U=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$V=\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{5} & -\\frac{4}{5} \\\\ \\frac{4}{5} & \\frac{3}{5}\\end{bmatrix}$" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186371355 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371355 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "e66d06cf-403a-5e08-92e6-6e31654cb2f7" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371356 #edb/ref 1080 "$U=\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} & -\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} & \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\end{bmatrix}$ and $V=\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} & \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} & \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\end{bmatrix}$" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186371356 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186371356 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "006adb9d-7d91-5c92-8d26-391d7b8d5193" #